{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level up, Collect items, Combine your weapons and BLAST ENEMIES!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You find yourself in the endless void, surrounded by enemies. Each wave is deadlier, each blast more spectacular. Customize your spaceship with upgraded engines, unique effects, and power-ups; dodge enemy fire with precision while unleashing your arsenal across the screen!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Key Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense Arcade Action \u2013 Fast-paced battles that push your reflexes to the limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguelike Structure \u2013 Every run is unique, with countless combinations of weapons, engines, and abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explosion-Focused Visuals \u2013 Colorful, retro-inspired effects that dominate the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgradeable Spaceship \u2013 Enhance your engines, weapons, and special abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcade Spirit Atmosphere \u2013 Neon space visuals paired with immersive electronic music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect items</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074700/extras/9708cb714d444c4954c1277a26b13144.poster.avif?t=1767688826\" aria-label=\"Collect Items\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074700/extras/9708cb714d444c4954c1277a26b13144.webm?t=1767688826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074700/extras/9708cb714d444c4954c1277a26b13144.mp4?t=1767688826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combine your weapons</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074700/extras/ae13eb995daa6928db7230e728e8bd22.poster.avif?t=1767688826\" aria-label=\"Combine Your Weapons\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074700/extras/ae13eb995daa6928db7230e728e8bd22.webm?t=1767688826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074700/extras/ae13eb995daa6928db7230e728e8bd22.mp4?t=1767688826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle against amazing bosses</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074700/extras/534d6f0ee006e7d617af8941727c31bf.poster.avif?t=1767688826\" aria-label=\"Battle Against Amazing Bosses\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074700/extras/534d6f0ee006e7d617af8941727c31bf.webm?t=1767688826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074700/extras/534d6f0ee006e7d617af8941727c31bf.mp4?t=1767688826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4074700?t=1767688826","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074700/548ac54895f0d3bc01b542bb7454a718b14b7f1a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767688826","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074700/6969b08a0a3a0b35f623a642d00b19c989acf443/cap